[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4719068370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4719068370","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4719068370,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGUdE0g","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:07:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T13:07:29Z","body":"> Should probably make into 4.7, but since it's a translatable string change, I don't know if it's too late.\r\n\r\nWe already have some outdated strings. We'd need one more translation sync to fix that, or if this PR was merged, 2 syncs.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4719068370/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4724040989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4724040989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4724040989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGZMlHQ","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T22:07:00Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T22:07:00Z","body":"I may be overthinking this, but the change introduces a petty localization issue, outside of these changed lines.\r\n\r\n**Most** of the times, \"_asset_\" and \"_resource_\" are distinct terms for Godot.\r\n- An \"asset\" is either what you download from the Asset Store, or a file _before_ being imported into the project and thus appearing in the FileSystem dock.\r\n- A \"resource\" is Godot's own Resource object, and what you generally manage within the editor.\r\nIt's _not quite_ how it works, but that's the general sentiment.\r\n\r\nThe problem is that, because the line between what turns into a \"resource\" is muddy, and because the two terms are often synonyms, some languages are inclined to translate both \"asset\" and \"resource\" as... the equivalent of \"resource\".\r\nSo, if we are to _not_ instruct the translations properly, the top of the editor will have a \"Resources\" main screen, even though it's not about Godot's Resources at all. This would make the distinction between the two even muddier.\r\n\r\nIn comparison, naming the main screen \"_Asset Store_\" is not a problem because most languages would keep the name as is (like \"Play Store\"), or at least keep the \"store\" part which removes any potential ambiguity.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4724040989/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4724351327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4724351327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4724351327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGZfhXw","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T23:05:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T23:05:47Z","body":"We could just add a translation context to it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4724351327/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4724489756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4724489756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4724489756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGZn-HA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T23:29:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T23:29:36Z","body":"tbh I find the premise of this PR rather overreactive. Ever since main screen names were translateable, the top of the editor in Polish looked like this:\r\n<img width=\"1349\" height=\"153\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6f1259d-f5bd-4b71-bcde-57debb77091e\" />\r\nThere is still plenty of space, you'd need to have a really small screen for it to be a problem.\r\n(interestingly, the Asset Store translation makes that button smaller)\r\n\r\n> We could just add a translation context to it.\r\n\r\nRight now \"Assets\" is a unique string, so it doesn't help.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4724489756/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":4,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4727352251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4727352251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4727352251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGcWruw","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T07:43:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T07:43:27Z","body":"> > We could just add a translation context to it.\r\n> \r\n> Right now \"Assets\" is a unique string, so it doesn't help.\r\n\r\nPedantically, @YeldhamDev probably wanted to mean an \"Explanation\", not \"Context\" in the way PO files use it to disambiguate. We all make this mistake, I guess.\r\nContext is usually one or a few words. In this case it doesn't really help because it [doesn't tell the full story](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4724040989).\r\n\r\n> There is still plenty of space, you'd need to have a really small screen for it to be a problem.\r\n\r\nThe fact that the after adding _just one more main screen_, the \"screen selector\" becomes nasty to work with... One may argue that's a flaw of the editor's UX itself. These buttons were never really designed to be expandable, and it became more obvious when the **Game** screen got added.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4727352251/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4731022240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4731022240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4731022240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGf2roA","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T13:55:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T13:57:14Z","body":"> Pedantically, @YeldhamDev probably wanted to mean an \"Explanation\", not \"Context\" in the way PO files use it to disambiguate.\r\n\r\nI actually did meant PO disambiguation here, but in this case, it would be used to explain what the word is being used for. I'm quite sure Weblate shows those in the UI, so translators would be made aware. Unless it being a unique string as KoBeWi said means it won't?\r\n\r\n~In any case, if \"Assets\" won't do it, then maybe just \"Store\"? Or maybe that would be even more confusing? :stuck_out_tongue:~ Just read the proposal, no \"Store\" either then.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4731022240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4731180133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4731180133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4731180133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGgAUZQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T14:08:35Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T14:08:35Z","body":"> I'm quite sure Weblate shows those in the UI, so translators would be made aware.\r\n\r\nYeah, knowing the context does not really help. Maybe it depends on the language, but as Mickeon mentioned, \"assets\" and \"resources\" are rather interchangeable terms and often translate to the same word.\r\n\r\nAlso \"assets\" alone is ambiguous, it may as well be used for some high-level asset manager ([like this one for example](https://store.godotengine.org/asset/sn1ks0h/global-asset-manager/)).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4731180133/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4734236942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4734236942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4734236942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGi65Dg","user":{"login":"DeanLemans","id":111811264,"node_id":"U_kgDOBqoawA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111811264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans","html_url":"https://github.com/DeanLemans","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeanLemans/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T19:06:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T19:06:31Z","body":"why not just \"Store\"?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4734236942/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":3,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4734247631","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-4734247631","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":4734247631,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGi7izw","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T19:07:56Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T19:07:56Z","body":"Just for the sake of argument instead of going purely by vibes, as of writing this, here's how some languages translate specifically the exact string that is being changed here:\r\n\r\n| Language | Translation | Note |\r\n| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| French | Botiga d'actius | \"actius\" literally means \"assets\" |\r\n| Spanish | Tienda de Assets | |\r\n| Catalan | Botiga d'actius | \"actius\" literally means \"assets\" |\r\n| Chinese (Simplified Han script) | 资源商店 | \"资源\" roughly means \"resource\" |\r\n| Czech | Obchod Zdrojů | They use \"Zdroj\" for both \"asset\" and \"resource\" thorough the localization.\r\n| Hungarian | Asset Store |\r\n| Italian | Asset Store |  |\r\n| Korean | 애셋 스토어 | \"에셋스\" literally means \"assets\"\r\n| Polish | Sklep Zasobów | They use \"Zasób\" for both \"asset\" and \"resource\" thorough the localization.\r\n| Russian | Asset Store |\r\n| Swedish | Asset-butik |\r\n| Turkish | Varlık Mağazası | \"Varlık\" literally means \"assets\"\r\n| Ukrainan | Магазин ресурсів | \"ресурсів\" means \"resource\"\r\n\r\n\r\nI must heavily note that it's hard to be consistent outside of this specific string. So for example, from what can notice and confirm myself, both French and Spanish _sometimes_ just say \"resource\" when they actually mean \"asset\"\r\n\r\nTo be honest the real question to ponder is whether it's worth keeping the distinction between the two terms. I personally think it is, as there seems to be a genuine, albeit flawed, effort to keep them separated around the place.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4734247631/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5370393437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-5370393437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":5370393437,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQBmzXQ","user":{"login":"alexanderprimaris","id":317498922,"node_id":"U_kgDOEuymKg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317498922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris","html_url":"https://github.com/alexanderprimaris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderprimaris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T13:29:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T13:43:39Z","body":"I don't see an issue with leaving it as \"Assets\" for languages like spanish, given that it is currently listed as \"Tienda de Assets.\"\n\nFurthermore, if the untranslated/out of context term itself is the issue, then \"scripts\" (which remains untranslated in the spanish configuration and other lenguajes) should be a thing too. \n\nAt least from my perspective as a native spanish speaker, I don't think there's a problem. And also, I would like to see it simplified.\n\nI support translation and accessibility, but practically anyone who uses a programming language (and using one is something Godot eventually requires) is bound to know a few english terms, or key words, and I believe \"asset\" just like \"script\" is universal enough among developers and most of new users.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5370393437/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5377134465","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120330#issuecomment-5377134465","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120330","id":5377134465,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQICPgQ","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-22T01:35:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T01:35:59Z","body":"It's already possible to fully hide it with \"Manage Editor Features...\" if someone wants more space, but it's kinda hidden.\r\n\r\nMaybe it should be somehow more obvious instead? It could be an additional easier to access sub-menu inside the `Editor` menu that allows you to toggle the currently shown main screen buttons.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5377134465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]